      "lines": [
        "在空间里，如同平面上一样，射线的方向相同具有反身",
        "性：$h\\uparrow\\uparrow h$；对称性：如果$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_2$，那么$h_2\\uparrow\\uparrow h_1$；传递性：如果",
        "$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_2$和$h_2\\uparrow\\uparrow h_3$，那么$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_3$",
        "（图65）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所有与同一条直线方向相",
        "同的射线的集合，叫做在空间",
        "的方向."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任何一条射线完全确定与",
        "它同方向的射线的全体的集"
      ]
    },
